    "title": "SUV Strikes Semi After Failing to Yield at Merrick County Intersection - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Tyler Cavalli ,\n12 hours ago GENORA – Merrick County Deputies were detailed to Highway 30 and Highway 39 to investigate a two vehicle crash Monday afternoon. A preliminary investigation concluded that a Toyota RAV 4 was traveling northbound on Highway 39 when it failed to yield the right of way when entering Highway 30 and struck an eastbound traveling Kenworth semi hauling a utility trailer. Read full article",
